{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"proposals\":[{\"actors\":[\"Securities and Futures Commission (SFC), issuer of the circular and operator of e-IP on WINGS\",\"Investment Products Division (IPD), the administering SFC division receiving applications and submissions\",\"Applicant or submitting investment-product participant\",\"e-IP online application/submission system on the SFC WINGS portal\"],\"classification_assumptions\":[\"The assessed submission concerns an investment product administered by IPD.\",\"The relevant act is an application or submission made on or after 30 November 2024.\",\"“Via e-IP” means the submission was actually made through the e-IP system, rather than an existing channel.\"],\"missing_information\":[\"Identity of the submitting participant and investment product\",\"Whether the particular product is administered by IPD\",\"The date of the application or submission\",\"Whether the submission was actually made through e-IP\",\"Whether any source-defined exception applies to the particular submission\"],\"objects\":[\"Application or post-authorisation/registration submission concerning an investment product\",\"Investment product administered by IPD\",\"Submission channel: e-IP on WINGS or an existing channel\",\"Parallel-run cutoff date of 30 November 2024\"],\"reading\":{\"assumptions\":[\"The Boolean result evaluates satisfaction of the stated mandatory e-IP submission condition for one identified application or submission.\",\"A date on or after 30 November 2024 is within the full-adoption period described by the circular.\"],\"citations\":[{\"quote\":\"After the extended period, applications and submissions of investment products administered by the Investment Products Division (IPD)1 must be submitted to IPD via e-IP from 30 November 2024.\",\"unit_id\":\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0\"},{\"quote\":\"Starting 30 November 2024, ie, after the parallel run period, applications and submissions of investment products administered by IPD must be submitted via e-IP.\",\"unit_id\":\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528\"},{\"quote\":\"During this period, the SFC continues to accept applications and submissions via existing channels.\",\"unit_id\":\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u3.737\"}],\"distinction\":\"This is a condition on the required submission route during the full-adoption period. It does not itself determine licence possession, legal compliance, or whether a submission is prohibited.\",\"family\":\"scope\",\"formalization\":{\"facts\":[{\"meaning\":\"The assessed item is an application or submission of an investment product.\",\"name\":\"is_application_or_submission\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0\",\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean classification of the assessed item\"},{\"meaning\":\"The investment product concerned is administered by the Investment Products Division (IPD).\",\"name\":\"product_administered_by_ipd\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0\",\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean classification of product administration\"},{\"meaning\":\"Calendar date on which the assessed application or submission is made.\",\"name\":\"submission_date\",\"requires_judgment\":false,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0\",\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528\"],\"type\":\"date\",\"unit\":\"Gregorian calendar date\"},{\"meaning\":\"The assessed application or submission was made through e-IP.\",\"name\":\"submitted_via_eip\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u0.0\",\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u8.1528\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean fact about submission channel\"},{\"meaning\":\"The assessed application or submission was made through an existing non-e-IP channel.\",\"name\":\"submitted_via_existing_channel\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"d19f9ecf9fd26.u3.737\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"Boolean fact about submission channel\"}],\"result\":\"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] (and is_application_or_submission product_administered_by_ipd (>= submission_date (date 2024-11-30)) submitted_via_eip)\",\"result_type\":\"bool\",\"scope\":\"For one identified application or submission, the result is true exactly when it is an application or submission concerning an IPD-administered investment product, made on or after 2024-11-30, and actually submitted via e-IP; false means at least one of those factual conditions is false. This result does not determine legal approval or overall compliance.\"},\"local_id\":\"mandatory_eip_route_condition\",\"questions\":[\"Is the assessed item an application or submission of an investment product?\",\"Is the investment product administered by IPD?\",\"What is the submission date?\",\"Was it submitted through e-IP, or through an existing channel?\",\"Does any applicable exception alter the route requirement for this submission?\"],\"statement\":\"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] The mandatory e-IP submission-route condition is satisfied for the assessed application or submission when the item is an IPD-administered investment-product application or submission made on or after 30 November 2024 and it was submitted via e-IP.\" ,\"subject\":\"One application or submission of an investment product\"},\"relationships\":[\"The SFC circular establishes the cutoff date and the required route for applications and submissions concerning IPD-administered investment products.\",\"IPD is the receiving division for the covered applications and submissions.\",\"e-IP is the required submission channel from 30 November 2024 after the extended parallel-run period.\",\"Existing channels were accepted during the parallel-run period before the full-adoption date.\"] ,\"schema_id\":\"ipd_eip_submission_route_condition\",\"temporal_basis\":\"Submission date controls: the parallel run ends on 29 November 2024 and the e-IP route requirement starts on 30 November 2024.\",\"unit_of_assessment\":\"One identified application or submission concerning one investment product\"}],\"unresolved\":[]}"}}
